{'symbol': 'ED', 'date': '2022-10-21 16:08:00', 'title': 'ASTORIA STUDENTS RECEIVE MENTORING AT BOYS & GIRLS CLUB FOR PATHS TO STEM CAREERS', 'text': 'NEW YORK--(BUSINESS WIRE)--YOUTH AT THE VARIETY BOYS & GIRLS CLUB OF QUEENS TODAY JOINED A “SPEED MENTORING” SESSION FOCUSED ON ENVIRONMENTAL CAREERS AS THEY LEARNED ABOUT ELECTRIFIED TRANSPORTATION AND GREEN ENERGY JOBS FROM REPRESENTATIVES OF THE NEW YORK POWER AUTHORITY (NYPA), CON EDISON AND 174 POWER GLOBAL, A RENEWABLE ENERGY COMPANY.'}